    ('FM-051', 'Bearing wear', 'EQ-PUMP', 'Project-local ID and label from a synthetic pilot scenario; not an ISO 14224 code. Mechanism not inferred. Added after Sprint 1 review; possible overlap with FM-019 - confirm.', 'PENDING_REVIEW')
